    (mandatory-overrides "--reviewers and explicit reviewed repository overrides retain all-of approval requirements; default quorum one also applies to Knoxx.")
    (provider-check-classification "Exact provider labels and the three reviewed job/workflow tuples in SKILL.md classify check outputs only. Required check flags and mandatory reviewers override optional classification; evidence/compilation/test/gate/unknown tuples remain deterministic. Native job names never grant reviewer identity, approval, completed-round credit or cohort membership; failed/pending provider outputs retain their observed states.")
